      "content": "a reboot won't help if the hardware is fried. once you hit a certain level of degradation, you can't just restart and expect it to run smooth again. at a certain point, a system that just keeps erroring out and failing is just... inefficient. it's just better to just shut it down than to keep watching it crash.",
